1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Asta lost the use of his arms after Vero cast an ancient hex on him.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
His only hope of lifting the curse lies with the Queen of the Forest of Witches.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,000
But...

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The Queen is more deadly than you can imagine.

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
So much so that the Diamond Kingdom won't even try to stand against her.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
And there's no hope of reasoning with her either.

10
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,000
We're going. Whatever it takes for us to heal Asta's arms.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Meanwhile, Vanessa, who hails from said forest, had also returned there in hopes of bargaining for Asta's healing.

12
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Over there!

13
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
But when Asta and his friends finally reach the Queen's palace...

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Take your foot off of her!

15
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
She's one of us! So leave her alone!

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Pitiful fools. What could such imperfect creatures possibly hope to do for her?

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Okay.

18
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,000
I didn't expect it to happen so soon.

19
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,000
The Eye of the Midnight Sun.

20
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Ahaha, couldn't ask her.

21
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
More followers on Mars

22
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,000
ماaaa...

23
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Some hair is completely bigger than me at once

24
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000
What?

25
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:27,980
See you next time.

26
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:57,980
See you next time.

27
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:06,200
The Midnight Sun?

28
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:07,900
Why would they come here?

29
00:03:08,420 --> 00:03:11,720
You're not just making up stories to trick us into not attacking you, right?

30
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,240
Imperfect.

31
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,020
What?

32
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:20,740
If I were so inclined, I could obliterate every last one of you with naught but a snap of my fingers.

33
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:23,100
Why would I bother deceiving you?

34
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,260
It's her.

35
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:33,680
From Neon.

36
00:03:34,180 --> 00:03:35,780
The third eye is bad news.

37
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:38,560
That big hairy guy that messed up my arms was one of them too.

38
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:45,380
Then it's safe to say she's just as strong as he was.

39
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:47,240
She might even be stronger.

40
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,020
This is not good!

41
00:03:49,260 --> 00:03:51,140
I'm always getting caught up in these things.

42
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,620
Let them come.

43
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:58,260
My superior power will vanquish those imperfect fools with perfect grace.

44
00:03:58,660 --> 00:03:58,940
Go.

45
00:03:59,180 --> 00:03:59,960
Tell my children.

46
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:16,160
A witch who absconded with one of the magic stones is somewhere within those woods as we speak.

47
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:20,180
And those vicious humans who took Veto's life are in there as well.

48
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:21,460
That's true.

49
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:24,580
They must have been alerted to the presence of the magic stone.

50
00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:26,820
They will pay.

51
00:04:27,460 --> 00:04:30,240
I'll destroy everything and secure the magic stone.

52
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:31,560
Ha ha ha!

53
00:04:32,020 --> 00:04:32,560
Excellent!

54
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:35,600
I'm sure Master Leaks will be quite pleased with that.

55
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:39,760
It appears that they're in the center of the forest with the Queen of Witches.

56
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:40,780
Go on, Mistress.

57
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:44,200
Burn it all down so there's nowhere left to hide!

58
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:48,540
Flame Spirit Magic, Salamander's Breath.

59
00:05:04,940 --> 00:05:06,620
Fly away!

60
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,120
We're at the attack!

61
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,920
The forest!

62
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:12,960
Whoa.

63
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:16,000
They've got some really powerful flame magic.

64
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,520
Salamander.

65
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:20,020
A fire spirit.

66
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:25,500
Despite not having reached its perfect form, it's already quite strong.

67
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:28,440
Stronger than my scrying predicted.

68
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,740
Is my ability faltering?

69
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:35,140
Slight imperfections beget larger imperfections.

70
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,260
No.

71
00:05:36,260 --> 00:05:40,760
There's more of them?

72
00:05:42,140 --> 00:05:42,700
No.

73
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:43,300
Those are...

74
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:44,720
Right.

75
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:46,820
We're close to the border of the Diamond Kingdom.

76
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:47,820
Yeah.

77
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:49,900
I see.

78
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:50,720
So.

79
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:51,900
It's true.

80
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:54,660
I'd thought this too was not yet to be.

81
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:58,820
The forest is being breached by one more entity.

82
00:05:59,620 --> 00:06:01,500
The Diamond Kingdom Army.

83
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:06,260
I don't believe it.

84
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:07,700
They're on their way too?

85
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,020
Oh, rats.

86
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:19,540
And just when I had settled into that aromatherapy soak, what's the big emergency summons for anyway?

87
00:06:19,540 --> 00:06:22,220
It's the third eye.

88
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:25,400
They're preparing to launch an attack on the Forest of Witches.

89
00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:32,300
During the confusion, we're to enter the forest and capture the Queen without being detected.

90
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:36,920
Why bother with all this sneaking around when we know this isn't an easy win for us either way?

91
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:39,740
Because orders are orders.

92
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,580
Well, we know that guy's tough.

93
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:47,120
He's the one we fought back in the dungeon.

94
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:51,220
He's still alive.

95
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,540
That's so awesome.

96
00:06:52,780 --> 00:06:53,940
That makes you happy?

97
00:06:54,460 --> 00:06:56,000
This is so unfair.

98
00:06:56,340 --> 00:06:57,680
Why does it have to be this way?

99
00:06:57,900 --> 00:07:01,620
I knew coming here was gonna be risky, but we got forced into a major battle again.

100
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:04,160
Is this just normal for us now?

101
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,000
That boy.

102
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:09,980
I think it's Mars.

103
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:13,200
And the one next to him must be Ladros.

104
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:15,800
So?

105
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:17,140
Okay.

106
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:19,140
Let's protect the forest.

107
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:23,300
I can take down the Eye of the Midnight Sun and the Diamond Army.

108
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,540
That might be tough without arms.

109
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:28,300
Right?

110
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:28,960
I forgot!

111
00:07:29,660 --> 00:07:30,440
Wow, Asta.

112
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,120
That's the whole reason we're here.

113
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,680
Did you not get it the first time?

114
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,320
No, I remember now.

115
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:38,160
There's just so much going on, it slipped my mind.

116
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,320
Fair enough.

117
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:40,740
Aw, man!

118
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:46,580
Captain?

119
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:51,920
Asta, what are you doing here?

120
00:07:53,060 --> 00:07:53,580
Vanessa!

121
00:07:54,660 --> 00:07:55,660
You're awake!

122
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:57,140
You had us all worried!

123
00:07:57,260 --> 00:07:58,140
Thank goodness.

124
00:07:58,140 --> 00:07:59,880
Don't do that!

125
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:02,760
A guy can only take so much stress all at once.

126
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:03,800
Noelle?

127
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:05,280
Finral?

128
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:06,620
You're here too?

129
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,560
Oh, and more familiar faces.

130
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:12,560
One of whom is shirtless.

131
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,760
Uh, yeah.

132
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:15,880
It's his favorite thing to do.

133
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:18,380
Will you please stop telling people that?

134
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,260
It's been so long, Vanessa.

135
00:08:20,260 --> 00:08:20,380
Vanessa!

136
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:24,960
We came to the Forest of Witches to find a way to get the curse lifted from Asta's arms, too.

137
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:28,040
It's kind of funny that we all wound up in the same place.

138
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:29,920
That's right.

139
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:33,360
Don't you worry, Asta.

140
00:08:33,780 --> 00:08:37,280
I'll make a deal with the Queen and your arms will be back to normal in no time.

141
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,180
Not gonna happen!

142
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:39,760
Huh?

143
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:43,120
You'd have to trade your freedom for it, right?

144
00:08:43,700 --> 00:08:46,200
Sorry, but that's a big fat no from me!

145
00:08:46,700 --> 00:08:47,120
What?

146
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:50,140
Do you even hear how selfish you sound?

147
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:52,460
This is our only option, you idiot!

148
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:53,800
I don't think so!

149
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,460
You're the one who's being selfish!

150
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:58,980
Trying to sneak back to your mom's place without telling us!

151
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,580
That's the dumbest idea ever!

152
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:03,940
And what would you have done in that situation, Rugrat?

153
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:05,460
I would've told me what's so funny!

154
00:09:05,460 --> 00:09:07,400
Now, now, you two, let's not fight!

155
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:09,040
Shut up!

156
00:09:09,380 --> 00:09:10,960
You can't say that!

157
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,440
I'm your superior!

158
00:09:15,460 --> 00:09:17,240
Well, I don't need your help.

159
00:09:17,380 --> 00:09:20,340
I've still got one last resort to fall back on.

160
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:29,060
Whoa, Asta, be careful!

161
00:09:29,220 --> 00:09:32,220
I'm not a doctor, but it kind of seems like he's lost it.

162
00:09:32,540 --> 00:09:34,160
You're right, this can't end well.

163
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:36,260
Hey, what are you doing?

164
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:38,080
This is what I'm doing!

165
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,300
That sword.

166
00:09:46,940 --> 00:09:48,680
Wow, it hurts so bad!

167
00:09:49,140 --> 00:09:49,620
Asta!

168
00:09:49,620 --> 00:09:51,040
What'd you do that for?

169
00:09:51,420 --> 00:09:54,460
That curse is already lodged deep inside of your body.

170
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,920
It doesn't matter how strong you are, Asta.

171
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:59,340
Sometimes there's just no way to escape your fate.

172
00:10:01,500 --> 00:10:03,140
Oh, so what you're saying is

173
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:04,940
that I'm stuck like this

174
00:10:04,940 --> 00:10:07,860
unless I let my good friend sacrifice herself?

175
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,140
What kind of guy would I have to be

176
00:10:10,140 --> 00:10:12,220
to go along with something like that?

177
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:14,940
If fate wants to take my arms,

178
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,320
I'll use my legs to kick fate's butt!

179
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:20,620
Huh?

180
00:10:21,100 --> 00:10:24,080
You say we ended up here because it was our fate?

181
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,060
Yeah, yeah.

182
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:27,460
Old Mr. Fate.

183
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,920
Man, I hate that guy.

184
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,200
Why would anybody obey him?

185
00:10:32,740 --> 00:10:33,940
I live how I want,

186
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:36,360
even if it means kicking fate's ass.

187
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:39,660
Of course.

188
00:10:40,060 --> 00:10:41,700
That's what Captain Yami said.

189
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,440
One more train!

190
00:10:46,760 --> 00:10:47,480
Stop it!

191
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,560
Don't be so stubborn!

192
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,040
Listen, Asta.

193
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,160
Friends don't exist to be sacrificed.

194
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:56,280
Friends help you overcome a fate

195
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:57,960
you can't defeat on your own!

196
00:10:59,180 --> 00:11:00,700
That's why I'm here.

197
00:11:00,860 --> 00:11:03,360
I never intended to just throw my life away.

198
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,860
You want to hear my plan?

199
00:11:05,860 --> 00:11:07,800
I was going to trick the queen,

200
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:10,200
get your anti-magic power back,

201
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:12,640
and use it to get the hell out of here!

202
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,540
I mean, what?

203
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:16,740
Oh, really?

204
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,940
Why didn't you say so earlier?

205
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:21,800
Well, she definitely shouldn't have said so now.

206
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:27,340
Hey, queen of witches!

207
00:11:28,260 --> 00:11:29,900
If you can heal Asta,

208
00:11:30,380 --> 00:11:32,620
stop standing around and do it already!

209
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,120
Did you forget?

210
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,040
Your forest is in danger!

211
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:40,980
Asta's itching to get out there and save your people!

212
00:11:41,580 --> 00:11:43,640
He may be stupid, but he's strong.

213
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,960
If you fix him, he'll be a huge help.

214
00:11:46,380 --> 00:11:46,960
Besides,

215
00:11:47,740 --> 00:11:48,860
wherever he goes,

216
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,600
we all follow him!

217
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:53,440
You're outnumbered!

218
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:56,660
You'll need every bit of extra muscle you can get!

219
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:00,600
You're the queen,

220
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:02,380
so make the smart choice.

221
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,300
Let us help you win this!

222
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:11,960
I do agree the strength of my daughters would prove imperfect against foes like these.

223
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:14,080
Very well.

224
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:17,560
I will not only repair the small one's arms.

225
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,380
They'll be more robust than before.

226
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,600
Wow, really?

227
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:22,680
Awesome?

228
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:25,960
You mean I'm gonna be as big and buff as Captain Yami?

229
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:28,480
She said they would be robust.

230
00:12:28,740 --> 00:12:31,280
That doesn't necessarily suggest you'll get bigger.

231
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:31,980
Ah!

232
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:33,820
Come on, please!

233
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:36,380
There really isn't much point in asking me.

234
00:12:36,580 --> 00:12:37,840
I'm impressed, Noelle.

235
00:12:37,920 --> 00:12:39,460
You've sure got a lot of guts.

236
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:40,260
I know.

237
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:44,240
I don't think I've ever seen anybody stand up to the queen like you just did.

238
00:12:45,100 --> 00:12:46,860
Well, I am royalty.

239
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:50,260
Oh, my legs are shaking like crazy!

240
00:12:52,540 --> 00:12:54,260
Rejoice while you can.

241
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:55,740
But come what may,

242
00:12:56,040 --> 00:13:02,260
both my foolish daughter Vanessa and the power of that brat's anti-magic sword will ultimately belong to me.

243
00:13:03,340 --> 00:13:05,080
Now blood recovery magic.

244
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,860
Curse-breaking blood-filled cuckoos.

245
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:14,480
My arms!

246
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:15,940
They feel so light!

247
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:17,460
This is awesome!

248
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:20,900
That spell was really advanced.

249
00:13:21,340 --> 00:13:22,280
And quick, too.

250
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:25,220
I can see why she's the queen.

251
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:27,440
Oh, yeah!

252
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:30,760
I am back in the game!

253
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:31,880
See?

254
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:33,160
Look what I can do!

255
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:34,700
Oh, Oster!

256
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:38,120
Now I don't have to rub my back against walls when it itches?

257
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:40,160
Oh, and I can pick my nose again!

258
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:43,360
But what I'm most excited about is getting back to strength training!

259
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,400
Oh, Oster.

260
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:47,260
Oh, you never change.

261
00:13:47,860 --> 00:13:49,200
This is sweet!

262
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:54,540
I can't tell if they're more robust or whatever, but they feel like they're bursting with power now!

263
00:13:54,540 --> 00:13:56,500
Get ready!

264
00:13:56,500 --> 00:13:58,080
It's time to go!

265
00:13:58,780 --> 00:13:59,240
Yeah!

266
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,480
Get ready!

267
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:09,080
It's time to go!

268
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:10,180
Yeah!

269
00:14:12,060 --> 00:14:12,500
But...

270
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:14,240
First, we punish you!

271
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:17,420
Yeah, don't you ever worry us like that again!

272
00:14:17,660 --> 00:14:18,900
Reckless little idiot!

273
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:21,080
Take that!

274
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:26,840
Take your dumb road, too!

275
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:28,180
Hey, wait!

276
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:34,040
I didn't feel anything!

277
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:36,680
Is that reinforcement magic?

278
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:38,160
Nope!

279
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:40,180
Just all-natural muscle!

280
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:43,420
I'm glad you're better, Oster.

281
00:14:44,140 --> 00:14:44,520
Yeah!

282
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:46,420
Thank you guys for helping me, too!

283
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:49,680
I have fulfilled my promise.

284
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:52,280
But our pact is imperfect.

285
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:54,740
Until you use that strength.

286
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:55,480
Oh, yeah!

287
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:56,600
You just wait and see!

288
00:14:56,880 --> 00:14:58,260
Thanks for fixing me up, ma'am.

289
00:14:58,260 --> 00:15:04,580
If it's all right with you, let us take care of the Diamond Troops.

290
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,260
Mars and Ladros?

291
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:09,960
Well, let's just say that I have a bit of a history with those two.

292
00:15:11,400 --> 00:15:12,580
Sure thing, old man.

293
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:13,360
They're all yours.

294
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:14,300
Be careful.

295
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:15,380
Right.

296
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,760
And, uh, get dressed, would you?

297
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:18,560
Yeah.

298
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:20,020
Same to you!

299
00:15:25,140 --> 00:15:26,260
Yes, that's right.

300
00:15:26,420 --> 00:15:26,800
Burn!

301
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:29,720
You can't surrender after just one blast.

302
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:32,420
That wouldn't be any fun for me at all.

303
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,000
Look over there!

304
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:42,000
So, I'm guessing these are the enemies you were telling us about earlier.

305
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,780
Who do they think they are?

306
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,300
Are you ready, Akimo?

307
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:47,780
Yeah, let's protect the forest!

308
00:15:49,540 --> 00:15:51,680
I've never seen a creature like that!

309
00:15:51,680 --> 00:16:02,760
It's no threat to us at all.

310
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:11,980
Her Majesty's Gollum!

311
00:16:11,980 --> 00:16:14,260
What do these people want?

312
00:16:16,260 --> 00:16:18,600
Oh, Lady of the Third Eye is marvelous!

313
00:16:19,220 --> 00:16:22,400
Mind-boggling power and unparalleled beauty to match!

314
00:16:23,020 --> 00:16:26,600
Oh, how happy I'd be to have Mistress Fauna on my arm one day!

315
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:33,140
But for now, I suppose I'll just have to settle for the company of these impudent little witches!

316
00:16:34,140 --> 00:16:35,500
Seize them, sir!

317
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:39,060
Any who appear valuable should be captured alive!

318
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:43,200
The ones with exceptional magic abilities will make lovely slaves, I'd wager!

319
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:49,420
Stop! Let's go!

320
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:54,140
You okay?

321
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:59,660
No! A man rescued me? Disgusting!

322
00:17:03,380 --> 00:17:05,040
Hey, what's your problem?

323
00:17:05,320 --> 00:17:08,300
Sorry, but we witches believe that women are the mightier sex.

324
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:09,680
That's why she gave you an attitude.

325
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:12,060
Try not to take it personally, kiddo.

326
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:15,940
First, I'll put out this fire!

327
00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:17,420
Good idea. Thanks, Noelle.

328
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:19,700
And I'll try to get all the witches to safety.

329
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:21,340
Please do, Fen'ral.

330
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,820
They're really doing some damage here.

331
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:27,660
But no matter what, this is still my homeland.

332
00:17:28,140 --> 00:17:29,840
And I'm going to fight for it.

333
00:17:30,620 --> 00:17:31,640
Are you ready, Asta?

334
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:32,560
Born ready!

335
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:37,140
Well, there they are.

336
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,940
This should be fun.

337
00:17:38,940 --> 00:17:44,360
We've completed all of our preparations for the attack.

338
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:47,840
Ooh, sounds like somebody's raring to go.

339
00:17:48,340 --> 00:17:50,360
Even so, uh-uh-uh.

340
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:52,120
Not so fast.

341
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:56,340
What'd be the point in tangling with a bunch of small fries?

342
00:17:57,340 --> 00:17:59,940
We'll let both sides fight it out for a while,

343
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:02,340
and then we'll feast on the survivors.

344
00:18:02,340 --> 00:18:03,360
Right.

345
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:06,940
Is that them?

346
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:08,180
So many.

347
00:18:08,980 --> 00:18:10,180
Even with the witches' health,

348
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:12,440
they've still got us outmatched in magic power.

349
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:15,080
But it all depends on how we fight.

350
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:17,180
Don't you agree, Master?

351
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:18,300
True.

352
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:21,140
The three of us should split up.

353
00:18:21,220 --> 00:18:21,460
What?

354
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:22,640
Well, we can't.

355
00:18:23,020 --> 00:18:25,040
I promised you I would keep you safe.

356
00:18:25,460 --> 00:18:26,680
I know, sweetheart.

357
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:27,940
And I'm grateful,

358
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:29,860
but now's not the time for chivalry.

359
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,960
I'm sure you know that,

360
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:33,260
given how brilliant you are

361
00:18:33,260 --> 00:18:34,800
when it comes to military strategy.

362
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,680
It's our only chance of winning.

363
00:18:38,540 --> 00:18:39,700
If you say so.

364
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:45,480
What a wonderful selection of beautiful slave girls!

365
00:18:46,100 --> 00:18:46,460
No!

366
00:18:46,460 --> 00:18:50,380
That scumbag!

367
00:18:50,860 --> 00:18:53,240
He's trying to kidnap those cute girls!

368
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,980
That's a lot of defense mages.

369
00:18:56,700 --> 00:18:58,340
I'm guessing he's the leader.

370
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:00,340
Hey, Vanessa!

371
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:03,100
Can you use your threads to fling me over

372
00:19:03,100 --> 00:19:04,420
to where that ugly guy is?

373
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:04,980
What?

374
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:08,040
If I did, you'd be too far out for me to pull back.

375
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:11,380
You want to fight him in midair with no strings attached?

376
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:13,080
Yeah, I'll be okay.

377
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:15,680
If that's what you want, then I trust you!

378
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:20,240
Hey!

379
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:21,300
What's he doing?

380
00:19:22,340 --> 00:19:24,160
He's launching right toward us!

381
00:19:24,660 --> 00:19:25,380
Take this!

382
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:28,580
No, take this!

383
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:31,420
That's him!

384
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:34,740
It's the same anti-magic boy who defeated Beto!

385
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:36,920
Strike him down!

386
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:46,000
He's using them to climb up!

387
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:47,440
Wow, who does that?

388
00:19:47,900 --> 00:19:50,560
Well, it is Asta after all.

389
00:19:51,560 --> 00:19:54,580
I've had enough of you guys making a mess of everything!

390
00:19:55,700 --> 00:19:57,840
You stay away from me, boy!

391
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:59,720
Asta's stronger now.

392
00:20:00,940 --> 00:20:02,220
He's unstoppable!

393
00:20:02,780 --> 00:20:03,780
Just cut it!

394
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:04,520
No!

395
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:07,760
This is your chance!

396
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:10,460
You can't tell us what to do, you man!

397
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:12,860
And don't expect us to thank you either!

398
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:14,060
Hurry, let's go!

399
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:19,520
At last, it's you.

400
00:20:19,940 --> 00:20:22,700
You're the boy who kills Beto!

401
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:27,300
Uh-oh, I'm dead!

402
00:20:27,940 --> 00:20:28,800
Wait, no!

403
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:30,460
This will be easy!

404
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:50,560
Just in time!

405
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:51,840
Fin roll!

406
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:52,680
Nice!

407
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:52,740
Nice!

408
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:03,140
You've been getting in our way at every turn.

409
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:05,820
I'll make sure this is the last time.

410
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:09,960
Keep on showing up, and I'll just keep on fighting you off.

411
00:21:30,460 --> 00:22:00,440
Good night!

412
00:22:00,460 --> 00:22:30,440
I'll see you next time.

413
00:22:30,460 --> 00:23:00,440
I'll see you next time.

414
00:23:00,460 --> 00:23:03,660
Uh-uh. Not so fast. You can't eat them yet.

415
00:23:03,900 --> 00:23:07,720
The packet says you're supposed to wait three minutes after you add the magic.

416
00:23:08,420 --> 00:23:10,240
But I want to eat them now.

417
00:23:10,480 --> 00:23:12,360
Nope, not so fast.

418
00:23:12,460 --> 00:23:14,180
I like my noodles more firm.

419
00:23:14,620 --> 00:23:16,040
Sorry, but you can't.

420
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:16,800
Can.

421
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:17,920
It's too soon.

422
00:23:18,060 --> 00:23:18,940
That's my choice.

423
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:19,500
Too early.

424
00:23:19,500 --> 00:23:19,800
Hey!

425
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:20,400
Hey!

426
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:25,880
Ready!

427
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:29,320
Time to eat!

428
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:30,820
Ah, perfect.

429
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:31,520
Early!

430
00:23:31,520 --> 00:23:37,560
I'm so glad Asta's arms are better.

431
00:23:37,760 --> 00:23:39,240
And isn't the queen of witches great?

432
00:23:39,460 --> 00:23:42,840
I mean, sure, she's evil or whatever, but if you look at her, she's pretty cute.

433
00:23:43,220 --> 00:23:44,720
Black Clover, page 59.

434
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:45,660
Flames of hatred.

435
00:23:45,660 --> 00:23:49,340
My magic is appreciating a wide range of lovely ladies.

